{"id":4679,"date":"2025-06-03T13:48:02","date_gmt":"2025-06-03T04:18:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=4679"},"modified":"2025-10-26T16:50:53","modified_gmt":"2025-10-26T07:20:53","slug":"terms","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/bigcommerce-app-store\/terms\/","title":{"rendered":"Big-Commerce App Store Terms"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4679\" class=\"elementor elementor-4679\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-55e97a0 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"55e97a0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2bba9d9\" data-id=\"2bba9d9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91e1a3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"91e1a3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">BigCommerce App Terms of Service<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4bddf1e elementor-section-content-top elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4bddf1e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e511bb0\" data-id=\"e511bb0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f934b2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f934b2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">BigCommerce App\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b16ca75 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b16ca75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The FeedOps app for BigCommerce accesses and processes store data solely for the purpose of enabling feed optimization, product synchronization, and advertising campaign management on platforms such as Google Shopping, Google Ads, and Microsoft Advertising.<\/span><\/p><p><b>Data Collected from BigCommerce Stores:<\/b><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Product information (title, description, price, availability, SKU, etc.)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Store configuration (currency, language, domain)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Store owner and staff contact details (for communication and account linking)<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><b>How We Use BigCommerce Data:<\/b><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To generate and optimize product feeds for supported marketing channels<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To provide insights, reporting, and suggestions for product performance<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To synchronize feed data between your BigCommerce store and advertising platforms<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To ensure successful campaign setup, management, and maintenance<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><b>Data Sharing and Retention:<\/b><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps does <\/span><b>not sell<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, share, or disclose your BigCommerce data to third parties, except as necessary to perform services you request or to comply with legal obligations.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All merchant\/store data retrieved from BigCommerce is used strictly for the purposes outlined above and is protected in accordance with our data protection and encryption practices.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Store data is retained only as long as necessary to provide the services or as required by law.<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><b>Uninstallation and Data Removal:<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> When a BigCommerce merchant uninstalls the FeedOps app:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We will automatically remove any store-specific data from our systems within 30 days.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h4><b>Payments<\/b><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps is a paid service. For full pricing details, visit our <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/price-solo\/\"><b>Pricing Page<\/b><\/a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you uninstall the FeedOps app from your BigCommerce store, your subscription will be automatically canceled, and <\/span><b>no further charges will be applied<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>BigCommerce App Terms of Service BigCommerce App The FeedOps app for BigCommerce accesses and processes store data solely for the purpose of enabling feed optimization, product synchronization, and advertising campaign management on platforms such as Google Shopping, Google Ads, and Microsoft Advertising. Data Collected from BigCommerce Stores: Product information (title, description, price, availability, SKU, etc.) [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"parent":4678,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4679","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Big-Commerce App Store Terms - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"FeedOps uses BigCommerce store data solely to optimize product feeds and ads, ensuring secure synchronization, insights, and compliance.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/bigcommerce-app-store\/terms\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_U